        "陶土质感/earthy textures",
        "低饱和度色彩/low saturation colors",
        "手写体排版/Handwritten typography",
        "自然光下的陶器/porcelain under natural light",
        "简洁文案语气/simplified tone",
        "网红滤镜对比/Instagram filters comparison"
      ],
      "language": "zh"
    },
